      <description>&lt;div class="wi_fic_desc" property="description"&gt;&lt;p&gt;Every fairy tale warns us about the wolf waiting in the forest's shadows. Rarely do we stop to ask what happens when wolves sit on the throne, and the rightful heir must hide beneath a crimson hood just to survive.&lt;/p&gt; &lt;p&gt;The Prince Underneath the Red Riding Hood began with a single image: a rose that refused to wither, and a flower whose petals bloom in the colours of the human heart. In the Duchy of Salia, magic belongs solely to the royal bloodline—a gift meant to serve the people, yet one that invited envy, betrayal, and fifteen years of silence.&lt;/p&gt; &lt;p&gt;This is a story about the quiet endurance of kindness in a world ruled by fear. It is about a boy forced to erase his own name to stay alive, a loyal friend who refused to believe a glowing rose could lie, and the fragile, fierce hope that blooms even in the darkest soil.&lt;/p&gt; &lt;p&gt;Thank you for stepping into the forest of Salia and taking this journey with me. May you find a light of your own beneath the hood.&lt;/p&gt; &lt;p&gt;— M. Sirena&lt;/p&gt; &lt;/div&gt;</description>
