      <title>Love and Extinction in Equal Measure</title>
      <author> EESharp </author>
      <link>https://www.scribblehub.com/series/2679275/love-and-extinction-in-equal-measure/</link>
      <comments>https://www.scribblehub.com/read/2679275-love-and-extinction-in-equal-measure/chapter/2679280/#comments</comments>
      <guid isPermaLink="false">ab152034622ef54e10a1570ad27edbd3ea34cdbf</guid>
      <pubDate>Fri, 27 Nov 2026 16:45:12 +0000</pubDate>
      <description>&lt;div class="wi_fic_desc" property="description"&gt;&lt;p&gt;The stars hold their dreams, but they also hide nightmares…&lt;/p&gt; &lt;p&gt;Molly craves adventure, and she’s willing to risk everything for it. Raz desires true love, and she can jump between worlds. Together, they leap at an opportunity from a time traveler who promises them everything they ever wished for.&lt;/p&gt; &lt;p&gt;All he asks in return are things they already wanted to do—to jump between countless planets while searching for great truths and a greater love. He even offers them a time-bending safety-net, a glimmering calling card to alter history exactly once.&lt;/p&gt; &lt;p&gt;But when Molly leaves Earth, she becomes the pebble tossed into the river of history, threatening to alter its entire course. A powerful civilization in the deep future refuses to tolerate any further changes to their timeline, fearing they’ll vanish without being born.&lt;/p&gt; &lt;p&gt;Messages are sent back to the present, threats and temptations alike, ensuring that zealous conspirators guard the roads out of Earth. A dictator’s army captures them only minutes after their first jump, and Molly and Raz turn to each other, seeking the comfort of a friend. They find so much more.&lt;/p&gt; &lt;p&gt;A daring prison break ignites the spark between them, even as they’re falsely accused of attempted murder. Their passion is kindled while they evade an interplanetary manhunt, and the flames of both love and war rise as their enemies hound them to an alien world.&lt;/p&gt; &lt;p&gt;As the body count grows, the temptation of the card looms, but changing history means giving up everything they’ve built together. They don’t want to go back.&lt;/p&gt; &lt;p&gt;Molly and Raz only want their dreams to come true. To protect their love, they have to jump from one world to the next, seeking those willing to fight for the present and defy the future.&lt;/p&gt; &lt;p&gt;What to Expect:&lt;/p&gt; &lt;p&gt;- Adventures across many planets, at least one new setting with every arc.&lt;br /&gt; - A slow-burn monogamous romance between a confident explorer and her giant goth girlfriend.&lt;br /&gt; - Very hard sci-fi, which appears magically soft at first.&lt;br /&gt; - Transhumans, aliens, and other critters!&lt;br /&gt; - Queer characters~&lt;br /&gt; - Found family~&lt;br /&gt; - This is a story about time travel, but it is not a time travel story.&lt;/p&gt; &lt;/div&gt;</description>
